<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bear Stearns starts paging stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bear Stearns starts paging stocks.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns started coverage of paging stocks, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- The source said Paging Network Inc and Arch Communications Group Inc were started as attractive, and both Mobile Telecommunications Technologies Corp and ProNet Inc as neutral.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for details.</p>
</text>
